{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 17, :comments ["<b>Because you listened to the voice of your wife.</b> In her relation to the blessed El — [a relation of] falsehood and envy." "<b>And you ate from the tree.</b> You transgressed and incurred death, as the warning had been. Now, because you <b>listened</b> and accepted her reasoning, misleadingly attributing [such qualities] to YHWH — <b>cursed is the ground</b>, which 'shall no longer give its strength to you' (Genesis 4:12) without labor. And this is because you transgressed My commandment."], :book :genesis, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 3, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:28:54.476420652Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}